	"data": "Transfer Thought\n\nFull no-code WebXR editor. The closest open-source equivalent to ShapesXR.\nRepo: <https://github.com/TransferThoughtLLC/transfer-thought>\nLicense: MIT\nStars: 176\nStatus: 5 years of development, just open-sourced\n\nWhat It Provides\nVisual scene editor for WebXR experiences\nNo-code interface for building spatial scenes\nAdvanced code editor mode for developers\nAWS hosting integration\n5 years of production development\n\nRelevance to Spatial Authoring\nValidates the concept: a no-code…",
